# Incident working data — real user plan JSON / exports. This repo is PUBLIC.
# Never commit raw user data here: plan JSON carries age, HR and training
# history, which is health data about an identifiable person. Written-up,
# aggregated findings in the incident analysis are fine; the raw record is not.
docs/incidents/**/user-*.json
docs/incidents/**/*-export.json
